        <rdfs:comment>Information about fields not published in this Notice. Additional Information: The non-published information may become available at a later date and may differ from one element to another within a given Document. Examples of fields that may not be immediately published are Winner, Tender and Procedure Lot Result, etc., e.g. for security reasons.</rdfs:comment>
