        <sh:description>Additional Information: In the ESPD, a Subcriterion is used to define national sub-criteria; maps to a UBL-2.3 cac:SubTenderingCriterion class. It is currently used only for purely national criteria, to be able to establish the mapping from eCertis.</sh:description>
