        <dct:description xml:lang="en">This property is intended to be used with non-literal values. This property is an inverse property of Is Replaced By.</dct:description>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A related resource that is supplanted, displaced, or superseded by the described resource.</rdfs:comment>
